sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Card payment with 3-D Secure
    accDescr: The checkout service authorises a card, steps up to 3-D Secure when the issuer asks for it, and captures on success.
    actor Shopper
    participant Checkout
    participant PSP as Payment provider
    participant Issuer

    Shopper->>+Checkout: Pay 49.00 EUR
    Checkout->>+PSP: POST /payments
    critical authorise the card
        PSP->>+Issuer: Authorisation request
        Issuer-->>-PSP: challenge_required
    option issuer asks for a challenge
        create participant ThreeDS as 3-D Secure page
        PSP->>ThreeDS: Redirect the shopper
        ThreeDS->>Shopper: Enter the one-time code
        Shopper->>ThreeDS: 483912
        destroy ThreeDS
        ThreeDS-->>PSP: challenge_passed
    option issuer declines
        PSP-->>Checkout: declined (insufficient funds)
    end
    PSP-->>-Checkout: captured
    Checkout-->>-Shopper: Order confirmed
